```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0756c9">

    <title>UMER COMPUTERS | Under Maintenance</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f5faff, #e4f0ff);
            color: #172b4d;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .maintenance-card {
            background: #fff;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 750px;
            padding: 50px 30px;
            border-radius: 24px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 55px rgba(0, 75, 170, 0.13);
            border: 1px solid #d9e9ff;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: clamp(30px, 6vw, 45px);
            font-weight: 900;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            color: #0756c9;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .logo span {
            color: #172b4d;
        }

        .tagline {
            color: #718096;
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .icon {
            width: 100px;
            height: 100px;
            background: #e8f2ff;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 0 auto 25px;
            font-size: 46px;
            animation: float 3s ease-in-out infinite;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #0756c9;
            font-size: clamp(27px, 5vw, 38px);
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .message {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #596579;
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 0 auto 25px;
        }

        .notice {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #edf5ff;
            color: #0756c9;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            border: 1px solid #d5e7ff;
        }

        .loader {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            margin-bottom: 28px;
        }

        .loader span {
            width: 10px;
            height: 10px;
            background: #0756c9;
            border-radius: 50%;
            animation: bounce 1.2s infinite ease-in-out;
        }

        .loader span:nth-child(2) {
            animation-delay: 0.2s;
        }

        .loader span:nth-child(3) {
            animation-delay: 0.4s;
        }

        .contact-text {
            color: #718096;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .phone-number {
            color: #0756c9;
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .buttons {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #fff;
            background: #0756c9;
            padding: 14px 22px;
            border-radius: 9px;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: bold;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn:hover {
            background: #063e91;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .whatsapp {
            background: #128c7e;
        }

        .whatsapp:hover {
            background: #075e54;
        }

        footer {
            margin-top: 35px;
            padding-top: 22px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e6edf5;
            font-size: 12px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: #8491a5;
        }

        @keyframes bounce {
            0%, 80%, 100% {
                transform: scale(0.6);
                opacity: 0.5;
            }

            40% {
                transform: scale(1.1);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        @keyframes float {
            0%, 100% {
                transform: translateY(0);
            }

            50% {
                transform: translateY(-8px);
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .maintenance-card {
                padding: 38px 20px;
            }

            .tagline {
                letter-spacing: 2px;
                font-size: 10px;
            }

            .message {
                font-size: 14px;
            }

            .buttons {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .btn {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <main class="maintenance-card">

        <div class="logo">
            UMER <span>COMPUTERS</span>
        </div>

        <p class="tagline">Your Technology Partner</p>

        <div class="icon">⚙️</div>

        <h1>We'll Be Back Soon!</h1>

        <p class="message">
            Our website is currently undergoing scheduled maintenance
            to improve your shopping experience. We're working hard
            to bring you a better, faster, and smoother website.
            Thank you for your patience.
        </p>

        <div class="notice">
            🚀 Our Website Will Be Live Again Within 24 Hours!
        </div>

        <div class="loader">
            <span></span>
            <span></span>
            <span></span>
        </div>

        <p class="contact-text">
            Need assistance? Our support team is here to help.
        </p>

        <div class="phone-number">
            +92 309 5827984
        </div>

        <div class="buttons">

            <a class="btn"
               href="tel:+923095827984">
                📞 Call for Support
            </a>

            <a class="btn whatsapp"
               href="https://wa.me/923095827984?text=Assalam-o-Alaikum%2C%20I%20need%20assistance%20from%20UMER%20COMPUTERS."
               target="_blank"
               rel="noopener noreferrer">
                WhatsApp Support
            </a>

        </div>

        <footer>
            &copy; <span id="year"></span> UMER COMPUTERS.
            All Rights Reserved.
            <br>
            Thank you for your patience and support!
        </footer>

    </main>

    <script>
        document.getElementById("year").textContent =
            new Date().getFullYear();
    </script>

</body>
</html>
```
